## 🎯 Material-UI Standards

### MUST FOLLOW: Component Usage
```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT: Use sx prop for styling
<Box sx={{ display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', mb: 2 }}>
  <Typography variant="h3" component="div" sx={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>
    {title}
  </Typography>
</Box>

// ✅ CORRECT: Use theme breakpoints
const theme = useTheme();
const matches = useMediaQuery(theme.breakpoints.up('sm'));

// ❌ WRONG: Inline styles
<div style={{ display: 'flex' }}>
```

### MUST FOLLOW: Theme Configuration
Reference: [theme.tsx](mdc:frontend-web/src/theme/theme.tsx)

```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT: Use theme colors
sx={{ color: 'primary.main', backgroundColor: 'primary.light' }}

// ✅ CORRECT: Follow component defaults
// All form components use size="small" by default
// All buttons use size="small" by default

// ✅ CORRECT: Theme color palette
palette: {
  primary: {
    main: '#0f5ab2',
    dark: '#043f84',
    light: '#2fcbef',
  },
  secondary: {
    main: '#f50057',
    dark: '#cb0047',
  }
}
```

### NEVER DO: Theme Violations
- ❌ Override theme colors with hardcoded values
- ❌ Use custom breakpoints outside theme
- ❌ Ignore component size defaults

## 🎨 Styling Patterns

### MUST FOLLOW: Styling Hierarchy (Priority Order)
1. **sx prop** - Primary styling method
2. **styled() components** - For reusable styled components
3. **theme overrides** - For global component styling
4. **CSS classes** - Only for external library integration

```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT: sx prop for component-specific styling
<Box sx={{ 
  display: 'flex', 
  alignItems: 'center',
  padding: { xs: '16px', sm: '24px' },
  backgroundColor: 'primary.light'
}}>

// ✅ CORRECT: styled() for reusable components
const StyledCard = styled(Card)(({ theme }) => ({
  borderRadius: '12px',
  boxShadow: '0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)',
  '&:hover': {
    boxShadow: '0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.15)',
  },
}));

// ✅ CORRECT: Conditional styling with sx
<Typography 
  sx={{ 
    color: isActive ? 'primary.main' : 'text.secondary',
    fontWeight: { xs: 400, sm: 500 }
  }}
>
```

### MUST FOLLOW: Styled Components Pattern
Reference: [BoardItem.tsx](mdc:frontend-web/src/components/BoardItem.tsx)

```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT: Typed styled component
interface TitleSpanProps {
  matches: boolean;
}

const TitleSpan = styled('span')<TitleSpanProps>(({ matches }) => ({
  fontSize: matches ? '18px' : '16px',
  fontWeight: 'bold',
  color: '#141414',
  lineHeight: '24px',
}));

// ✅ CORRECT: Theme-aware styled component
const StyledButton = styled(Button)(({ theme }) => ({
  borderRadius: '8px',
  textTransform: 'none',
  [theme.breakpoints.down('sm')]: {
    fontSize: '14px',
  },
}));
```

### NEVER DO: Styling Anti-Patterns
```typescript
// ❌ WRONG: Inline styles instead of sx
<div style={{ marginTop: '20px', color: 'blue' }}>

// ❌ WRONG: Creating styled components inside render
function Component() {
  const StyledDiv = styled('div')({ color: 'red' }); // ❌ Don't do this
  return <StyledDiv />;
}

// ❌ WRONG: Hardcoded pixel values without responsive consideration
sx={{ width: '320px', height: '240px' }} // Should use breakpoints

// ❌ WRONG: !important overrides
sx={{ color: 'red !important' }} // Use proper CSS specificity instead
```

## 🔤 Font & Typography

### MUST FOLLOW: Pretendard Font System
Reference: [index.css](mdc:frontend-web/src/index.css)

```css
/* ✅ CORRECT: Font weight hierarchy (priority order) */
/* Critical weights - loaded first */
font-weight: 400; /* Regular - most used */
font-weight: 500; /* Medium - second most used */
font-weight: 600; /* SemiBold - third most used */

/* Secondary weights - loaded as needed */
font-weight: 700; /* Bold */
font-weight: 300; /* Light */

/* Rarely used weights */
font-weight: 800; /* ExtraBold */
font-weight: 900; /* Black */
font-weight: 200; /* ExtraLight */
font-weight: 100; /* Thin */
```

### MUST FOLLOW: Typography Patterns
Reference: [theme.tsx](mdc:frontend-web/src/theme/theme.tsx)

```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT: Typography component usage
<Typography variant="h3" component="div" sx={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>
  Main Title
</Typography>

<Typography variant="body1" sx={{ fontSize: '0.9rem', fontWeight: 400 }}>
  Body text content
</Typography>

// ✅ CORRECT: Font family fallback
fontFamily: [
  'Pretendard',
  '-apple-system',
  'BlinkMacSystemFont',
  '"Segoe UI"',
  'Roboto',
  'sans-serif'
].join(',')
```

### MUST FOLLOW: Font Performance
```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT: Font display optimization
@font-face {
  font-family: 'Pretendard';
  font-display: swap; /* Prevents FOIT (Flash of Invisible Text) */
  src: url('path/to/font.woff2') format('woff2');
  unicode-range: U+0020-007E, U+AC00-D7AF; /* Subset for performance */
}
```

### NEVER DO: Typography Mistakes
- ❌ Don't use font weights not defined in the system
- ❌ Don't override fontFamily without fallbacks
- ❌ Don't use font-display: block (causes FOIT)
- ❌ Don't load all font weights if only using a few

