## 📱 Responsive Design

### MUST FOLLOW: Breakpoint Usage
```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT: Material-UI breakpoints
sx={{
  width: { xs: '100%', sm: '360px' },
  padding: { xs: '16px', sm: '24px' },
  fontSize: { xs: '14px', sm: '16px' }
}}

// ✅ CORRECT: Conditional rendering
const matches = useMediaQuery(theme.breakpoints.up('sm'));
return matches ? <DesktopComponent /> : <MobileComponent />;
```

### MUST FOLLOW: Mobile-First Approach
- Design for mobile first, enhance for desktop
- Use touch-friendly button sizes (minimum 44px)
- Ensure readable text sizes (minimum 16px)

